{"text":"#include <iostream>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\ntemplate <typename t>\nvoid swap(t a, t b);\n\ntemplate <typename t1>\nvoid Greater(t1 a , t1 b );\n\n\nint main(){\n\n\n    swap(3 , 6);\n\n    Greater(23, 89);\n\n\n    return 0;\n}\n\ntemplate <typename t>\nvoid swap (t a , t b){\n\n    cout<<\" the first number is  \"<< a <<\" and the second number is  \"<<b<<endl;\n\n\n    t1 temp = a;\n\n    a = b;\n\n    b = temp;\n\n     cout<<\" now the first number is  \"<< a <<\" and the second number is  \"<<b<<endl;\n\n\n}\ntemplate <typename t>\nvoid Greater(t1 a , t b){\n\n    cout<<\"the greater value is \"<<(a>b)? a:b;\n}\n","version":201,"snapshot":true,"doc":5,"seq":227,"ms":887836,"op":"edit"}
